= Overview =

Available since: PKI 10.7

= Listing Passwords =

<pre>
$ pki-server password-find
</pre>

= Adding Password =

<pre>
$ pki-server password-add internal --password Secret.123
</pre>

= Deleting Password =

<pre>
$ pki-server password-del internal
</pre>

